{"sourceUrl":"http://www.philo.ecnu.edu.cn/c3/ca/c36259a771018/page.htm","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:53:17.702809+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"http://www.philo.ecnu.edu.cn/c3/ca/c36259a771018/page.htm","html":"<div><p><span><span> 关于华东师范大学</span></span><span><span>哲学系</span></span><span><span><span><span>2027</span></span></span></span><span><span>年</span></span></p><p><span><span> 接收优秀应届本科毕业生免试攻读硕士研究生（含本科直博）</span></span></p><p><span><span> 预报名的通知</span></span></p><p><br/></p><p><span><span> 我系</span></span><span><span><span><span>2027</span></span></span></span><span><span>年接收优秀应届本科毕业生免试攻读硕士研究生（</span></span><span><span>含本科直博</span></span><span><span>）的预报名工作安排通知如下：</span></span></p><p><br/></p><p><span><span> 一、报名条件</span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>1.</span></span></span></span><span><span>中华人民共和国公民，拥护中国共产党领导，遵纪守法、品德良好；</span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>2.</span></span></span></span><span><span>已获得或预计获得就读学校推荐免试资格的优秀应届本科毕业生；</span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>3.</span></span></span></span><span><span>学习成绩优异，具有较强的创新意识、研究潜质和专业基础；</span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>4.</span></span></span></span><span><span>诚实守信，学风端正，无任何有违学术道德、专业伦理等行为；</span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>5.</span></span></span></span><span><span>身心健康，符合国家规定的体检要求。</span></span></p><p><br/></p><p><span><span> 二、报名流程</span></span></p><p><span><span> （一）时间及方式</span></span></p><p><span><span> 预报名时间为即日起</span></span><span><span>至</span></span><span><span><span><span>2026</span></span></span></span><span><span>年</span></span><span><span><span><span>9</span></span></span></span><span><span>月</span></span><span><span><span><span>4</span></span></span></span><span><span>日</span></span><span><span><span><span>17</span></span></span></span><span><span>：</span></span><span><span><span><span>00</span></span></span></span><span><span>。</span></span></p><p><span><span> 有意申请的考生请登录华东师范大学研究生报考服务系统（</span></span><span><span><span><span><a href=\"https://yjszs-ks.ecnu.edu.cn/logon?zsxm=5\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">https://yjszs-ks.ecnu.edu.cn/logon?zsxm=5</a></span></span></span></span><span><span>，以下简称报名系统）注册账号，填写并提交申请志愿。</span></span></p><p><span><span> 每位考生最多可注册两个账号，填报两条独立志愿。在我系规定报名截止时间（</span></span><span><span><span><span>2026</span></span></span></span><span><span>年</span></span><span><span><span><span>9</span></span></span></span><span><span>月</span></span><span><span><span><span>4</span></span></span></span><span><span>日</span></span><span><span><span><span>17</span></span></span></span><span><span>：</span></span><span><span><span><span>00</span></span></span></span><span><span>）前，考生可自行取消提交状态、修改完善后再次提交。</span></span></p><p><span><span> （二）报名材料</span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>1.</span></span></span></span><span><span>有效居民身份证；</span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>2.</span></span></span></span><span><span>教育部学籍在线验证报告；</span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>3.</span></span></span></span><span><span>预报名申请表（报名系统填写完毕后下载打印、签字后扫描上传）；</span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>4.</span></span></span></span><span><span>诚信承诺书（报名系统下载打印、签字后扫描上传）；</span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>5.</span></span></span></span><span><span>其他学习、科研或科创等材料：包括本科学习成绩单、外语能力证明、科研或科创成</span></span><span><span>果</span></span><span><span>以及其他能反映研究能力和创新潜质的材料、其他获奖证书等。请将</span></span><span><span>此类</span></span><span><span>材料</span></span><span><span>依</span></span><span><span>次排序扫描并合并为一个</span></span><span><span><span><span>PDF</span></span></span></span><span><span>文件上传系统，文件大小不超过</span></span><span><span><span><span>10MB</span></span></span></span><span><span>。</span></span></p><p><span><span> 强基计</span></span><span><span>划</span></span><span><span>转段、立</span></span><span><span>功</span></span><span><span>表</span></span><span><span>彰退役军</span></span><span><span>人免初试等</span></span><span><span>项</span></span><span><span>目不通过本系统报名。</span></span></p><p><span><span> 三、其他说明</span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>1.</span></span></span></span><span><span>考生须保证提交材料真实、准确，不得弄虚作假，不得有学术不端行为。</span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>2.</span></span></span></span><span><span>报名截止后，考生须密切关注报名系统中的审核状态及院系复试通知等信息。我系将在院系研究生招生工作小组的领导下成立材料审核组织专家组，对申请材料进行审核并确认是否接收申请，</span></span><span><span>遴选复试名单</span></span><span><span>，并根据上级部门和学校政策规范组织复试考核工作。请考生密切关注报名系统中的审核状态及院系复试通知等信息。</span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>3.</span></span></span></span><span><span>报名系统中展示的学科专业及研究方向仅供参考，我校</span></span><span><span><span><span>2027</span></span></span></span><span><span>年推免专业目录最终以全国推荐免试攻读研究生（免初试、转段）信息公开管理服务系统（网址：</span></span><span><span><span><span>https://yz.chsi.com.cn/tm/index.jsp</span></span></span></span><span><span>，以下简称推免服务系统）公布为准。</span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>4.</span></span></span></span><span><span>除预报名外，所有通过推荐免试方式攻读我系</span></span><span><span><span><span>2027</span></span></span></span><span><span>年研究生的考生均须在正式取得推免资格后，在推免服务系统履行填写报考志愿、接收并确认院系的复试及待录取通知等正式程序。推免服务系统正式开放时间请及时关注中国研究生招生信息网相关公告。</span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>5.</span></span></span></span><span><span>错过预报名的考生如仍有意愿报考我系，可在推免服务系统开通后直接报名。我系将结合实际，确定是否再次组织推免复试考核与录取。</span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>6.</span></span></span></span><span><span>若上级部门对推免招生工作有新的要求，我系将遵照执行。</span></span></p><p><br/></p><p><span><span> 四、咨询方式</span></span></p><p><span><span> 李</span></span><span><span>老师：</span></span><span><span><span><span>021-54342330      xli@philo.ecnu.edu.cn</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>（学院暑假轮休期间，建议优先通过电子邮件方式咨询）</span></span></span></span></p><p><br/></p><p><br/></p><p><span><span> 华东师范大学</span></span><span><span>哲</span></span><span><span>学系   </span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>2026</span></span></span></span><span><span>年</span></span><span><span><span><span>7</span></span></span></span><span><span>月</span></span><span><span><span><span>24</span></span></span></span><span><span>日    </span></span></p><p><br/><br/></p><div><p><span>3</span></p></div><p><br/></p></div>","textSha256":"69420f2fc7cce2bd9f2cad38aa9e3ac1959e3a113e57a6d4ec3bb3885db243b2","textLength":1278,"sourceSha256":"b949d6cdfbe56ebefebc7794b460ff5598747d2edddfc17e99407f92b334f250","selector":".wp_articlecontent","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-a93b95e32329ae3d9659","title":"2026年华东师范大学哲学系2027年接收优秀应届本科毕业生免试攻读硕士研究生（含本科直博）预报名的通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:53:17.702809+00:00"}
